        "availability_mode": "preorder",
        "subtitle": "A knitted polo in a viscose and cotton blend, cut to an athletic fit. High stretch through the chest and shoulders, tapered through the body, close without pulling.",
        "fabric_fit": "<p>Athletic fit. Shaped through the chest and shoulders, tapered through the body, close without pulling. It runs closer than the Portofino.</p><p>True to size if you want it close. If you sit between sizes, or you want it sitting looser through the middle, size up.</p>",
        "care": "<p>Machine wash cold. Reshape and dry flat so the knit holds its shape.</p>",
        "runway_heading": "Try the look."
      },
